# Performance constraints (social addon)

## Non-negotiables

- UI closed → effectively idle (events only)
- No permanent `OnUpdate` for business logic
- In combat: no full ladder rebuild storms
- Prefer ≪ 1 MB SavedVariables

## Budget

| Phase | Expectation |
|-------|-------------|
| UI closed | Events only |
| UI open | Interaction + ≤10 Hz dirty coalesce |
| In combat | No permanent OnUpdate |
| Login sync | Bursty then quiet |

Bar: invisible next to WA/Details/nameplates.

## Do / don’t

| Do | Don’t |
|----|-------|
| Event-driven scoring + roster | Per-frame proximity / combat scans |
| Dirty-flag UI; refresh ≤10 Hz when open | Rebuild full ladder per BeefNet message |
| Cap/rotate local event logs in SV | Unbounded SavedVariables growth |
| Cache roster lookups | Full guild rescan every suggestion |
| `C_Timer` / throttled ticks for buckets | Permanent `OnUpdate` for scoring/net |

```lua
-- ✅ GOOD — disable when idle
frame:SetScript("OnUpdate", nil)

-- ❌ BAD — scoring or net parse every frame
frame:SetScript("OnUpdate", function(_, elapsed) COB.Scoring:Tick(elapsed) end)
```

## Cross-cutting throttle

- BeefNet: CTL pacing; sync reply suppression (`beefnet-messaging.mdc`)
- Guild announce: one officer-origin line per promotion
- Instance drip: events + **low-rate** ticker; anti-AFK requires combat in the bucket

## SV size

Cache official ladder + revisions; treat My Standing logs as lossy/capped.
